1. Playing it

You can download, install and use the mod for free, for your own personal use. Videos, streams and
screenshots of it are fine.


2. Reuploading it as it is

You can't reupload, mirror or repost the mod or any of its files unchanged. That includes renaming it,
repacking it, changing a few settings or putting it in a modpack. Link to the official pages instead: the
GitHub repository above and my own Nexus Mods pages.


3. Forks and modified versions

You can share a modified version of the mod anywhere, a fork on GitHub included, as long as all of these
are true:

  a. You've done meaningful work on it, like new features, real fixes, new art or a real rework. Renaming,
     repacking, changing settings or reuploading it doesn't count.
  b. It clearly says it's a fork or modified version of GTA VI-Inspired HUD, and what you changed, where
     people get it (the top of its README or mod page).
  c. It credits Geckomacabre as the maker of GTA VI-Inspired HUD, with a link to
     https://github.com/Geckomacabre/GTA-VI-Inspired-HUD.
  d. You don't claim you made the whole mod, or any part of it you didn't make.
  e. It keeps this LICENSE file, and the credits and license files for the other people's work in it.
  f. The parts that came from my work stay under this license. Your own additions can be under any license
     you like.
  g. It's free, see 4.


4. Money

You can't sell the mod or a modified version of it, or put it behind a paywall, a Patreon tier or early
access.


5. Other people's work

These parts belong to the people who made them. This license doesn't give you any rights to them, so to
share them you need to follow their own terms:

  - The original VI HUD by FBICat (GTA6Hud.dll and its art), shared in this mod with FBICat's permission,
    for personal use. A fork that includes it needs FBICat's permission too.
  - The "GTA VI MiniMap (3D Buildings)" mod by moddims that the minimap is built on (ViMinimap.asi), GAVRA's
    map pictures and molot's minimap icons.
  - ViCustoms.dll, ViCrouch.dll and ViWasted.dll and their source in src\ are under the GPL-3, not this
    license. Their license files are next to them.
  - The radio code (src\ViExtras\Radio and scripts\ViExtras\Radio) is under the PolyForm Noncommercial
    License 1.0.0, not this license. See its LICENSE.md.
  - Sitting (src\ViExtras\Sit) is ported from dynamic-sit by Invalid0190, under the MIT license in
    scripts\ViExtras\Sit\LICENSE.md.
  - The nitrous (from StreetKings) and the NPC memory (from um_memory) are ported from other people's FiveM
    resources, and their authors keep the rights to their work.
  - LemonUI by Lemon (MIT), the Anton font by Vernon Adams (SIL Open Font License) and Grand Figma Kit VI
    (CC BY 4.0).
  - Rockstar Games' artwork, logos and trademarks. This is a fan mod. It isn't affiliated with or endorsed
    by Rockstar Games or Take-Two Interactive.


6. No warranty

The mod comes as it is, with no warranty of any kind. I'm not responsible for anything it does to your
game, your saves or your PC. Back up your game before installing mods.


